{159}{There are those who would look at all that has happened to you, and then look at you and call YOU a madman for not believing in the prophecy.  You're opinion is based on what you have seen, what you know.  My perceptions on the nature of life and death are no different...}{There are those who would look at all that has happened to you, and then look at you and call YOU a madman for not believing in the prophecy.  You're opinion is based on what you have seen, what you know.  My perceptions on the nature of life and death are no different...}{}{32}{}{}
{160}{Perhaps, but MY opinion doesn't threaten the whole of creation...}{}{5}{}{165}{}
