{485}{Yes...for the same crime on a grander scale.  And when we met here in the Void, I had become so much more powerful than he, and again he feared my words, and he made war against me.   And now he is in chains, and this Void has truly become his prison.  Not so for me...}{Yes...for the same crime on a grander scale.  And when we met here in the Void, I had become so much more powerful than he, and again he feared my words, and he made war against me.   And now he is in chains, and this Void has truly become his prison.  Not so for me...}{}{68}{}{}
